---
---

<section id="rules-section" class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-2 sm:px-4 mt-6 mb-4">
  <details class="group nes-card rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-6 border border-cyan-400/30 transition-all duration-300 open:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,229,255,0.15)]">
    
    <!-- Collapsible Header -->
    <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none select-none">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/20 border border-cyan-400/40 flex items-center justify-center text-base shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(0,229,255,0.3)] shrink-0">
          📖
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col text-left">
          <span class="text-[9px] font-['Press_Start_2P'] text-cyan-300">RULES & ORIGINS</span>
          <h2 class="text-xs sm:text-base font-bold text-white tracking-wide font-['Outfit'] mt-0.5">
            How Hexxagon Works (Rules & Mechanics)
          </h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0">
        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-cyan-400/70 hidden sm:inline group-open:hidden">Click to Expand</span>
        <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-[#090d1a] border border-cyan-400/40 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-300 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200 shadow">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </summary>

    <!-- Expanded Body Content -->
    <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-cyan-500/20 flex flex-col gap-4 text-xs text-slate-300">
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-mono">
        Hexxagon is an iconic strategy board game invented in 1993 by Software Creations. Played on a tessellated hexagonal grid, it challenges players to clone, leap, and infect adjacent opposing tokens.
      </p>

      <!-- 3 Core Mechanics Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
        
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#050814] border border-emerald-500/30 flex flex-col gap-1.5">
          <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/20 border border-emerald-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold font-mono">
            01
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-white font-['Outfit']">Cell Duplication (1 Step)</h3>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Moving 1 distance to an adjacent hex clones your piece, adding an additional friendly token to the board without sacrificing the original.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#050814] border border-amber-500/30 flex flex-col gap-1.5">
          <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/20 border border-amber-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 text-xs font-bold font-mono">
            02
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-white font-['Outfit']">Tactical Leap (2 Steps)</h3>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Jumping 2 distances teleports your piece to an open hex across enemy lines, vacating the initial position for surprise offensive strikes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#050814] border border-rose-500/30 flex flex-col gap-1.5">
          <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-rose-500/20 border border-rose-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-rose-400 text-xs font-bold font-mono">
            03
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-white font-['Outfit']">Infection Cascade</h3>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            When landing, all enemy pieces touching the target destination are converted to your color instantly, triggering massive point swings.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </details>
</section>
